<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Mod id="ac91d4ce-5685-494e-bdd5-f021a9d3980a" version="3">
  <Properties>
    <Name>JFD's Civilizations - Portugal (Afonso I)</Name>
    <Teaser>Adds [COLOR_CYAN]Portugal under Afonso I[ENDCOLOR]. Click for details.</Teaser>
    <Description>PORTUGAL (AFONSO I)[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]UNIQUE TRAIT: MIRACLE OF OURIQUE[NEWLINE]Defeating units in their lands will convert nearby [ICON_CITIZEN] Citizens to your main religion and damage nearby cities. Courthouses exude +25% religious pressure.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]UNIQUE BUILDING: CONVENTO (CASTLE)[NEWLINE]The unique Convento is the Portuguese replacement for the Castle under Afonso I. It increases the [ICON_PEACE] Faith and [ICON_STRENGTH] Defense of cities. In addition, the Convento allows all units purchased with [ICON_PEACE] Faith in this city to move immediately. It also does not require Walls to be built.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]UNIQUE UNIT: KNIGHT OF AVIZ (KNIGHT)[NEWLINE]The Knight of Aviz is the Portuguese unique unit under Afonso I. Perfectly suited for religious crusades, the Knight of Aviz heals when beginning its turn in the territory of a civilization following a different religion. Unlike the Knight which it replaces, this unit does not require [ICON_RES_HORSE] Horses to build, although it takes require more production.</Description>
    <Authors>JFD, Tarcisio, Janboruta, DarthKyofu</Authors>
    <HideSetupGame>0</HideSetupGame>
    <AffectsSavedGames>1</AffectsSavedGames>
    <MinCompatibleSaveVersion>0</MinCompatibleSaveVersion>
    <SupportsSinglePlayer>1</SupportsSinglePlayer>
    <SupportsMultiplayer>1</SupportsMultiplayer>
